# Carnage, Crimson Chaos: "return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard". Bot1's graveyard holds
# Llanowar Elves (mana value 1) and Simian Spirit Guide (mana value 3, the limit), which are the two legal targets, and
# a Cogwork Librarian (mana value 4), an Island and the sacrificed Black Lotus (not creature cards), while Bot2's graveyard holds an Ornithopter
# (not Bot1's graveyard): none of those three is a candidate (the refusal). Choosing the Simian Spirit Guide returns it.
# Faithless Looting, flashed back with Black Lotus's red mana, puts the cards of Bot1's into the graveyard on turn 1;
# Bot2 discards an Ornithopter to hand size on turn 2; Carnage is cast on turn 3.

